  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0c5cbb483bddf4c478998c8960188805, type: 3}
  m_Name: L3_TheShadowTalk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - '...You came back.

    I wondered how long it would take before curiosity dragged
    you here again.'
  - 'Listen carefully, Minh.

    This place is not empty.

    It only pretends
    to be.'
  - 'The hospital remembers everything that happened here.

    Every scream.

    Every
    shadow that learned how to move without a body.'
  - 'And now they wander the halls...

    looking for something that still breathes.'
  - 'But they are not fearless.

    They hate the light.

    Especially the violent
    burst of a camera flash.'
  - 'Take this camera.

    When one of them comes too close...

    look at it
    through the lens and strike with light.'
  - 'It won''t destroy them.

    Nothing truly disappears here.

    But it will
    make them stumble... long enough for you to run.'
  - 'If you want to leave this place,

    you must find the three fragments scattered
    through the hospital.'
  - 'Pieces of a photograph.

    Or maybe pieces of a memory this place refuses
    to forget.'
  - 'Somewhere in the halls you''ll find locked chests.

    Inside them are puzzles
    left behind by those who tried to escape.'
  - 'Solve them if you can.

    But don''t celebrate too early.

    Not every
    chest rewards hope.

    Sometimes... it only wastes your time.'
  - 'And time is the one thing you don''t have.

    The longer you stay here,

    the
    more the shadows begin to notice you.'
  - 'Find the fragments.

    Keep the camera ready.

    And whatever you hear
    behind you...'
  - Don't turn around unless you're ready to see it.
